  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Peel and de-vein shrimp, leave tails intact.",
    "3. In a large bowl, whisk together harissa, olive oil, cilantro, lemon juice, garlic, and salt.",
    "4. Add shrimp to the bowl and toss to coat with marinade.",
    "5. Thread shrimp onto skewers, leaving space between each shrimp.",
    "6. Grill skewers for 2-3 minutes per side, or until shrimp are pink and cooked through.",
    "7. Serve immediately, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
  ],
